# NOTE: server/ml/models/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The trained artefacts
# (timbre_model.pt, drum_bank/, *.joblib) are committed so the app works
# without a training run. Rebuild them with:
#   python -m scripts.train_timbre_model --epochs 80
#   python -m scripts.build_drum_bank --per-label 120